","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A Biome plugin matches syntax: it cannot ask the compiler or read another file.\nWhat the other rules would report reaches a Biome project two other ways —\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana</span> check","source":"kirana check"}},{"type":"text","value":" in CI, as pull-request annotations, and the\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/editor","children":[{"type":"text","value":"language server"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in the editor:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"# .github/workflows/ci.yml\n- run: npx kirana check src --format github --max-warnings 0","lang":"yaml","html":"# .github/workflows/ci.yml\n- run: npx kirana check src --format github --max-warnings 0"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"no-unused","source":"no-unused"}},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sort-properties","source":"sort-properties"}},{"type":"text","value":" stay ESLint and Oxlint only: counting member\nreads and ordering keys against the property table are beyond what GritQL can\nexpress."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"the-project-root","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The project root"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The project root is the nearest "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"kirana.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">config</span>.*","source":"kirana.config.*"}},{"type":"text","value":" above the file being linted. In a\nmonorepo whose packages shar